<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Welcome to Our Blog</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style="
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      padding: 30px;
      background-color: #f4f7f6;
      margin: 0;
    "
  >
    <div
      style="
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      "
    >
      <h2 style="color: #2c3e50; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px">
        Welcome, <%= name %>! 🎉
      </h2>

      <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6">
        We are thrilled to have you join our community. Your account has been
        successfully created.
      </p>

      <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6">
        You can now log in to your account, read amazing articles, and start
        publishing your own posts.
      </p>

      <div style="text-align: center; margin: 35px 0">
        <a
          href="http://localhost:3000/login"
          style="
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
          "
        >
          Log In to Your Account
        </a>
      </div>

      <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; margin: 30px 0" />

      <p style="color: #999999; font-size: 14px; text-align: center">
        If you have any questions, simply reply to this email. We're here to
        help!
        <br /><br />
        Best regards,<br />
        <strong>Nest Blog Team</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
